sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant APP as Mobile App
  participant API as Analytics API
  participant AN as Analytics Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  U->>APP: Open analytics summary
  APP->>API: GET /api/analytics/summary
  API->>AN: Build summary data
  AN->>DB: Query expense aggregates
  DB-->>AN: Aggregate results
  AN-->>API: Summary payload
  API-->>APP: Summary response
